are.\n\n'Cause I'm a woman\n\nPhenomenally.\n\nPhenomenal woman,\n\nThat's me.\"\n\n2. Mary Oliver\n\n(1935\u20132019)\n\nTo Read | Wild Geese, Breakage, Hummingbirds\n\nFor the nature lovers, Mary Oliver's powerfully feminine poetry inspires quiet moments of reflections based"
